ook, Instagram profiles. Recent changes in the register: employees set to 6 on 2026-04-14.","sentences":[{"text":"DUNAM GRUPPEN AS is a private limited company registered in Vinterbro, founded 2020-04-15.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c7"]},{"text":"DUNAM GRUPPEN AS is engaged in contracting work in the building and construction industry, and also in buying and selling shares and property, and in activities related to this, as well as supporting charitable and public-benefit purposes.","claim_ids":["c11","c10","c71"]},{"text":"It was previously named DUNAM 1 AS until 2022-01-10.","claim_ids":["c20"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 41.000: construction of residential and non-residential buildings.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 22 553 868 NOK and the annual result was 968 018 NOK; operating income was up from 22 034 923 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c54","c59","c43"]},{"text":"The annual result rose from 478 561 NOK in 2024 to 968 018 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c48","c59"]},{"text":"Equity fell from 1 435 723 NOK in 2024 to 943 837 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c51","c62"]},{"text":"Registered leadership: Vidar Sandersen (daglig leder and styrets leder).","claim_ids":["c27","c28"]},{"text":"Its verified website is dunam.no, which links to its Facebook, Instagram profiles.","claim_ids":["c70","c73","c74"]},{"text":"Recent changes in the register: employees set to 6 on 2026-04-14.","claim_ids":["c67"]}],"unknowns":["Open positions (NAV): No active NAV job ad names this organisation number as employer (index built 2026-11-07T08:17:35+00:00).","Hiring: no open NAV job ads and no careers page on the verified website.","Dated news: none found on the verified website."],"writer":"template_v2+model_description"},"changes":[],"refresh":{"previous_run_id":null,"compared_at":"2026-11-07T08:45:31Z"},"errors":[],"operations":{"requests":10,"runtime_ms":9152,"third_party_cost_usd":0,"llm_calls":1},"snapshots":[{"source_url":"https:/